INTERVIEW TRAP QUESTIONS
======================================================================

Trap 1

Question

Does TDD mean testing after development?

Correct Answer

No.

TDD means writing automated tests BEFORE writing production code.

---------------------------------------------------------------------

Trap 2

Question

What is the first step in TDD?

Correct Answer

Writing the test case.

Not writing the implementation.

---------------------------------------------------------------------

Trap 3

Question

What is the correct order in TDD?

Correct Answer

Write Test

↓

Test Fails (Red)

↓

Write Minimum Code

↓

Test Passes (Green)

↓

Refactor

---------------------------------------------------------------------

Trap 4

Question

During the Refactor phase, should functionality change?

Correct Answer

No.

Only the internal code structure is improved.
The external behavior must remain the same.

---------------------------------------------------------------------

Trap 5

Question

Should we write the complete implementation during the Green phase?

Correct Answer

No.

Write only the minimum code required to make the test pass.

---------------------------------------------------------------------

Trap 6

Question

Is TDD a testing technique or a software development methodology?

Correct Answer

TDD is a Software Development Methodology.

Testing is only one part of it.

